Project Definition

DEOXYS — AI Game Intelligence Fleet

Scope:

Deoxys = autonomous multi-agent game analysis + testing + behavioral modeling system

Separation rule is correct: it must not entangle with JARVIS canon systems.

This is a clean external system boundary.


---

Core Architecture

1. Deoxys Fleet Layer

DEOXYS_FLEET
├── SCOUT      → crash / softlock detection
├── CHAOS      → adversarial stress testing
├── EXPLORER   → world traversal + discovery
├── SPEEDRUN   → exploit + sequence breaking
├── ECONOMIST  → resource + economy stability
├── META       → balance + dominant strategies
└── UX         → interface + friction analysis

Each agent is:

stateless per run

behaviorally parameterized

scored via shared telemetry schema



---

2. Game Interface Layer

Game Adapter (Deoxys SDK)
→ input abstraction
→ action space mapping
→ observation capture
→ replay recorder

Supports:

Unity

Unreal

WebGL

Custom engines


Minimal requirement: expose an action + state interface.


---

3. Telemetry Core

Observation Stream
→ Action Log
→ State Diff
→ Outcome Delta
→ Event Graph

Everything becomes structured transitions:

(state A + action) → state B

This is the base of all later intelligence.


---

4. Game Genome Engine

Each game becomes a vector + graph hybrid:

Game Genome =
  mechanics distribution
  + system coupling graph
  + difficulty curve
  + exploit surface map
  + player behavior clusters

Not tags. Not genres. Structural signature.


