JARVIS ANALYSIS

Separation assessment:

System	Role

JARVIS	governance + memory + orchestration
DEOXYS	external analytical simulation fleet


Boundary integrity:

JARVIS ≠ runtime analysis engine
DEOXYS ≠ memory system

Risk check:

No overlap in persistence layer

No shared ontology dependency required

Safe to isolate as independent repo


Complexity level: moderate-high but modular.

Traceability preserved via:

Game → Simulation Run → Event Graph → Report

No silent mutation risks identified.


